                        <h2 class="title">校际联动促提升，教研共生谋发展 ——绍兴一中历史、政治学科组赴仙居中学交流研讨</h2>
                        <!-- 副标题 -->
                        <h3 class="subTitle"><span></span></h3>
                        <script>
                        $(".Subheading span:empty").parent().hide()
                        </script>
                        <div class="property"> <span>文章来源：</span> <span>作者：</span> <span>发布时间：2026年01月27日</span> <span>点击数：
    <script language="JavaScript" type="text/JavaScript" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/Common/GetHits.aspx?id=22718"></script>
    次</span>  <span><span id="content_AdminEdit"></span>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(document).ready(function()
{
    $.pe.ajax('admineditcheck',{params:{itemId:22718},success:function(s) {
        if ($(s).find('status').text() == 'OK') {
            var managedir = "/Common/GetContentEdit.aspx?itemId=22718";
           $("#content_AdminEdit").html("【<a href='" + managedir + "' target='_blank'>进入后台编辑</a>】")
        }
    }});
});
</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-indent:176px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:32px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为深入贯彻</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“县中崛起”行动计划，加强校际交流，分享教育教学经验，共同探索教学质量提升路径，</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2026</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">16</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日至</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">17</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日，绍兴一中历史、政治学科组在历史教研组长张叠、政治教研组长王淑会的带领下，赴仙居中学开展“县中崛起”交流研讨活动。</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/1/202601271700052158.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202601271700052158.jpg" /></span></p><p style="margin-left:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="margin-left:32px;text-indent:0"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">一、</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">课堂观摩：情境创新与素养导向的教学实践</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:32px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">仙居中学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">历史</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">教师郭宇晟执教</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">了</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">选择性必修三《</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“我”，人文，苏格拉底——欧洲文化的形成》一课，创新运用</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">AI</span><span style="font-family:宋体">技术模拟与古希腊思想家苏格拉底的互动对话，通过层层递进式问题链，将抽象的历史知识转化为具象的思维探究。</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">AI</span><span style="font-family:宋体">技术的融入让历史场景“活”了起来，充分体现了“以生为本”的教学理念与技术赋能的教学创新。课后，两校教师围绕课堂设计、</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">AI</span><span style="font-family:宋体">应用细节等展开研讨，分享教学心得与改进建议</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14px;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/1/202601271700415316.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202601271700415316.png" /></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p>
</p><p style="text-indent:32px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">我校政治组</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">茹奕蓓老师执教必修三《始终坚持以人民为中心》一课，本节课选择了</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“中国共产党不忘初心、牢记使命”的总议题，围绕议题构建丰富多样的教学情境，引导学生在学习体验中坚定走中国特色社会主义道路的信念。在之后的教研评课</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">环节</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">中，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">在场的政治教师均认为这节课</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">充分展示出茹老师扎实的教学功底，真正实现了情境创设、活动体验与知识建构、素养提升的有机结合。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/1/202601271651096798.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202601271651096798.png" /></span></p><p>
</p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p>
</p><h2 style="text-indent:32px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">二、专题讲座：</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">理论引领与实践赋能的双向发力</span></strong></h2><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:32px">
</p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/1/202601271653159320.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202601271653159320.png" />历史教研组长</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">张叠老师带来</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">了</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">《</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">AI</span><span style="font-family:宋体">赋能高中历史教学的应用举例》专题讲座</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">系统拆解了</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">AI</span><span style="font-family:宋体">技术在历史教学中的实用场景与操作方法，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">以</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">提升一线教师工作效率。例如在备课环节，</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px">AI<span style="font-family:宋体">可以高效整合五本历史教材</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、生成专题知识图谱；在改作业环节，</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">AI</span><span style="font-family:宋体">能实现自动批改与初步点评，节省教师重复劳动时间；在命题环节，</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">AI</span><span style="font-family:宋体">可根据教学目标生成多样化试题，并支持难度调整与错题溯源</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为精准教学提供数据支撑</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">张老师的</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">讲座内容兼具理论高度与实践价值，为</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">两校</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">教师提供了可直接落地的教学优化方案。</span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/1/202601271653347658.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202601271653347658.png" /></p><p style="text-indent:28px">
</p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">政治教研组长</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">王淑会老师</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">作了</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">《例谈省教育科学规划课题的申报》</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">专题</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">讲座。王老师以自己做的</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">浙江</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">省教育科学规划课题《基于境脉学习理论的高中政治议题式教学优化策略研究》为例，从</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“怎样进行课题选题”、“好的选题如何进行表述”、“课题论证的核心问题是什么”、“课题申请报告如何撰写”四个方面</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">有</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">针对性</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">地</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">解决了教师在课题研究中</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“不会选、不会写、不会论证”的痛点问题。仙居中学教师听完讲座后纷纷表示：“讲座内容干货满满，为我们参与课题研究指明了方向，今后将</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">更加</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">积极</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">地</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">投身教研实践，实现教学与研究的良性互动。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">”</span></p><p>
</p><p style="text-indent:32px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px">   <span style="font-family:宋体">三、结对共建：协同发展与共促提升的长远布局</span></span></strong></p><p>
</p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/1/202601271651564164.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202601271651564164.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/1/202601271651551624.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202601271651551624.png" /></p><p>
</p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">此次教研交流活动是绍兴一中与仙居中学结对帮扶工作的重要实践，通过</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“课堂示范</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">+</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">理论</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">引领</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">+</span><span style="font-family:宋体">深度研讨”的多元形式，有效促进了两校在教育教学理念、教学方法创新、课题研究开展等方面的互学互鉴，为“县中崛起”行动计划的落地见效注入了鲜活动力。活动结束后，两校教师均表示，此次交流实现了优质教育资源的共享共赢</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">常态化</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">的</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">校际教研、资源共享、教师互访等活动，推动</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">了两校</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">在教育教学改革中同频共振、共同成长</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px">，</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">携手助力两校教育事业高质量发展，为</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“县中崛起”贡献更大力量。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
